to video.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Search Queries Run & Key Takeaways\\n\\n1. **`python image object segmentation popup animation video GitHub` (2026)**\\n   - *Takeaway:* Identified that developers pair Segment Anything (SAM/SAM 2) or MediaPipe for mask isolation with programmatic compositing libraries (`MoviePy`, `Movis`, `OpenCV`). No single library claims the \\\"popup animation\\\" title natively; it is executed as a keyframe scale\n<truncated 14138 bytes>","Recipient":"\"0a1da317-8a4c-4e21-80c2-ef4667c39ddd\"","toolAction":"\"Sending message\"","toolSummary":"\"Send research report to parent\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking","tool_calls"]}
