{"step_index":81,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T22:46:31Z","content":"I have completed the research across all specified queries and sent the detailed report to the parent agent via `send_message`.\n\n### Summary of Findings\n1. **No Out-of-the-Box Monolithic Tool:** There is currently no single turn-key repository that executes all 4 steps (static image → auto-detect/segment objects → sequential popup animation → sound effect sync) in one CLI/UI command.\n2. **Key Repositories Identified & Categorized:**\n   - **Animation, Compositing & SFX Engines:**\n     - **`rezoo/movis`** (~485 stars, updated 2025): Python motion graphics library with keyframing, easing, and audio support.\n     - **`Zulko/moviepy`** (~12.5k stars, active 2026): Core video editing and layer scaling animation with synchronized audio.\n     - **`ManimCommunity/manim`** (~26.5k stars, active 2026): Programmatic reveals (`GrowFromCenter`, `FadeIn`) and audio sync.\n   - **Object Segmentation & Inpainting Foundations:**\n     - **`IDEA-Research/Grounded-Segment-Anything`** (~17.7k stars, active 2026): Zero-shot multi-object detection and segmentation into RGBA cutouts.\n     - **`geekyutao/Inpaint-Anything`** (~7.7k stars, active 2026): Segment Anything + inpainting to generate a clean base background.\n     - **`facebookresearch/sam2`** (~20k+ stars, active 2026): State-of-the-art visual segmentation for images and video.\n   - **Hybrid Pipelines (Segmentation + Video Animation):**\n     - **`stevenlsw/physgen`** (~353 stars, updated Oct 2024): Grounded-SAM + inpainting + rigid-body animation into video.\n     - **`provos/parallax-maker`** (~104 stars, active 2025/2026): SAM + ZoeDepth + inpainting for layered 2.5D animation.\n     - **`leeyeel/sketch2motion`** (~359 stars, updated Sept 2026): Vectorized contour decomposition + Manim step-by-step reveal animation.\n     - **`vt-vl-lab/3d-photo-inpainting`** (~7.1k stars, updated Aug 2024): Depth